<import src="../../templates.wxml"/><view class="screen {{large?'large':''}}"><view class="title">本人设置</view><template is="status" data="{{error,loading,busy,reminderError}}"/>
<view wx:if="{{session}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{session.me.name}}</view><view class="pill section">{{session.me.role==='elder'?'老人端':'家人 / 照护者端'}}</view><view class="muted spaced">{{session.name}} · {{session.memberCount}} 位家庭成员</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row between"><view>大字模式</view><switch checked="{{large}}" bindchange="large" color="#a44424" aria-label="大字模式"/></view></view><view class="card"><view class="row between"><view>消息提示音</view><switch checked="{{sound}}" bindchange="soundChanged" color="#a44424" aria-label="消息提示音"/></view><view class="small muted spaced">仅在小程序打开时播放，遵循系统静音与音量；录音或播放语音时不插播。</view><button hover-class="press-feedback" class="outline full section" bindtap="testSound" disabled="{{!sound}}">试听提示音</button></view><view class="card stack"><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="outline full" bindtap="go" data-page="family">家庭成员管理</button><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" wx:if="{{session.me.role==='guardian'}}" class="outline full" bindtap="go" data-page="elders">整理长辈资料</button><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="outline full" bindtap="go" data-page="todos">我的照护待办</button><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="outline full" bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{busy}}">导出可见的家庭记录</button><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="outline full" bindtap="go" data-page="privacy">用途与隐私说明</button><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="soft full" bindtap="logout">返回身份确认页</button></view><view class="notice">小程序打开时：新留言显示未读角标并尝试振动，SOS 弹窗提示；提醒不代表已经确认收到。退到后台后暂停检查。</view><view class="notice">{{session.notificationConfigured?'每次重要提醒需要可用的微信订阅授权。':'微信订阅模板尚未配置，暂不支持小程序外的微信推送。'}}</view><button hover-class="press-feedback" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" wx:if="{{session.notificationConfigured}}" class="primary full" bindtap="subscribe">允许下一条重要提醒</button><view class="brand-footer">暖心夕护小助手 · 家庭协作版 v4.2.1（本地修复版）</view></view>
</view>
